<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-blue via-brand-mid to-brand-deep text-white">
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-accent via-brand-orange to-brand-accent"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-36">
    <p class="mb-6 inline-flex rounded-full border border-brand-accent/50 bg-brand-accent/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-orange">
      Senior Microsoft-konsulenttjenester · Oslo
    </p>

    <h1 class="max-w-4xl text-5xl font-black leading-[1.1] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
      Microsoft-plattformen<br />
      <span class="text-brand-orange">på dine premisser.</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-slate-200 sm:text-xl">
      Vi hjelper virksomheter med å ta full kontroll over sin Microsoft-plattform — fra strategi og arkitektur til implementering, sikkerhet og videreutvikling.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
      <a href="#for-ledere" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-brand-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-orange hover:text-brand-blue">
        Hva dette betyr for din virksomhet →
      </a>
      <a href="#tjenester" class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10">
        Se tjenester og teknologier
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
